{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}
{% block title %}About Armadillo Tile and Home Repair{% endblock %}
{% block description %}Learn about Armadillo Tile and Home Repair, a local one-crew business serving Greater Baltimore with careful tile and home repair work.{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">About Armadillo</p>
  <h1>One Small Crew. One Solid Shell Of Work.</h1>
  <p>Armadillo Tile and Home Repair proudly serves Greater Baltimore with tile and home repair work handled with care.</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="content-card">
    <p class="card-label">How We Work</p>
    <h2>Careful Work. Clear Communication.</h2>
    <p>From full bathroom tile to small fixes that have bugged you for years, the goal is the same: show up, work clean, and leave it solid. You can expect one crew on site, clear communication, and realistic timelines.</p>
    <p>Every project is a little different. We take time to understand what you need, talk through the options, and give you honest pricing before work begins.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="card-grid">
    <article class="content-card">
      <h2>Local And Approachable</h2>
      <p>Based in Baltimore City, Armadillo focuses on Baltimore City and County while continuing to serve nearby communities, including Carroll and Howard Counties.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="content-card">
      <h2>Respect For Your Home</h2>
      <p>Neat work areas, straightforward updates, and attention to the details that make a finished project feel right.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="action-row">
  <a class="button-link" href="/contact/">Let's Talk About Your Project</a>
  <a class="button-link button-link-secondary" href="/service-areas/">See Where We Work</a>
</div>
{% endblock %}
